"Logs may include the following sensitive information taken at the time of each request to Siri over the past 24 hours:\n- The text of the request\n- The foreground app\n- Which apps are installed on the device\n- Your current location\n- People, apps, dates, email addresses, phone numbers, postal addresses, and URLs that are on screen\n- Output from any AppIntents used to satisfy the request\n- The view hierarchy of what is on the screen\n- The entities that were detected on screen\n\nYou can review the collected content in the attachments before submitting your radar.\n"
